invalid type: string "THE FRAMEWORK\nLangChain Building Blocks\nLangChain provides ready-made, swappable components for every stage of the RAG pipeline.\nDocument Loaders\nPyPDFLoader, WebBaseLoader, CSVLoader...\nText Splitters\nRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter and more\nEmbeddings\nOpenAIEmbeddings, HuggingFaceEmbeddings\nVector Stores\nChroma, FAISS, Pinecone integrations\nRetrievers\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ